  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Major feature release with Tier 1 features:\n• INotifyPropertyChanging support via [Notify(ImplementChanging = true)]\n• [NotifyCanExecuteChangedFor] attribute for automatic command CanExecute refresh\n• [NotifySuppressable] attribute for batch notification suppression (unique feature!)\n• 140 tests with 94.81% line coverage",
